  - "reproducibility"
  - "open science"
  - "engineering practice"
abstract: >-
  A positive practice instrument for concise, inspectable, revisable work.
  It reads self-declared tags and evidence labels against a versioned
  practice registry and returns one of four statuses over declaration
  coverage. It measures whether the evidence a practice asks for was
  declared — never whether the work is true, good, or permitted; an
  ALIGNED reading authorizes nothing.
